  "evidence": "Connected original producer/consumer reconstruction, corroborated by private normal-input modal probe. Backspace enters inventory;1B14 sets6DA,1DF6 clears it. IRQ C6EE/3B122 retain ticks/message service while gating selected motion/control; not a global pause. BD02 widens object BYTE26 into structure service WORD6C2;0/1/2 and10 select distinct command/depot paths, not a universal object-field type.1DAE/3498C build shared name pointers, quantity bytes and model IDs from104 count bytes;349C8 initializes ten pointer slots and ten bytes at each scratch prefix. Ten is initialized prefix, not proved list capacity; unchecked original cardinality and sentinel stores retained.1B84 formats names/counts atA2A; its capacity is unknown. Shared9CE is overwritten by inventory/depot/Taymar dialogue. Stardrive2F96C toggles0/FFFF only in space at speed>=64, rejection clears,377F4 clears below threshold; original events identify activation/deactivation.144C adds two extra speed-derived power debits when enabled (three total).752 starts16 resource-charge steps.754 counts title rate windows,756 counts presentation handoffs,160 counts IRQ service ticks,162 counts window handoffs,17C ticks each IRQ.15E is dual-use: IRQ window count, Amiga FPS path overwrites computed display value. No global boolean, all-input safety, exact physical-frame update rate, or arbitrary list bound inferred. Runtime used normal keys only; no guest register/memory writes; empty inventory did not establish nonempty formatting execution.",
